^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
is unknown
no body for callee
--
In Visual Studio mode the front end declared __builtin_strlen and
__builtin_memcmp only; the MSVC STL's char_traits also call
__builtin_char_memchr, __builtin_wcslen and __builtin_wmemcmp, and
<cmath> __builtin_copysign ("symbol ... is unknown", the body of
basic_string_view::find was dropped).
